web attack scans, privileged role grants and risky Server Scripts.",[388,500,502,507],{"icon":501,"to":107},"i-lucide-git-merge",[224,503,504],{"v-slot:title":226},[233,505,506],{},"One incident, not fifty emails",[224,508,509],{"v-slot:description":226},[233,510,511],{},"Events are grouped per site, bench or host. Channels hear about it when it opens, reopens and resolves.",[388,513,515,520],{"icon":514,"to":102},"i-lucide-bell-ring",[224,516,517],{"v-slot:title":226},[233,518,519],{},"Ten channels",[224,521,522],{"v-slot:description":226},[233,523,524],{},"Email, webhook, Raven, Slack, Mattermost, Matrix, ntfy, Gotify, SMS and PagerDuty, with signed Acknowledge \u002F Resolve links.",[378,526,527],{},[528,529],"u-page-c-t-a",{":links":530,"description":531,"title":532},"[{\"label\":\"Read the quickstart\",\"to\":\"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fquickstart\",\"trailingIcon\":\"i-lucide-arrow-right\"},{\"label\":\"View on GitHub\",\"to\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fbthuner\u002Fdodock-wolf\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"variant\":\"subtle\",\"icon\":\"i-simple-icons-github\"}]","Dodock Wolf is MIT-licensed and runs on the Frappe site you already operate.","Open formats, self-hosted storage, no usage-based pricing.",[534,535,536],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sHwdD, html code.shiki .sHwdD{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#546E7A;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#676E95;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);ba